<body>
    <h1>Order Analytics</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h3 local-id=3D"a6e285572b84" id=3D"OrderAnalytics-ReportsModule-Or=
derAnalyticsDashboard">
<style>[data-colorid=3Do1tndfnejq]{color:#0747a6} html[data-color-mode=3Dda=
rk] [data-colorid=3Do1tndfnejq]{color:#5999f8}[data-colorid=3Dgsj266mpdd]{c=
olor:#0747a6} html[data-color-mode=3Ddark] [data-colorid=3Dgsj266mpdd]{colo=
r:#5999f8}</style><strong>Reports Module - Order Analytics Dashboard</stron=
g></h3>
<h3 local-id=3D"8adbb775bf17" id=3D"OrderAnalytics-Metrics:"><strong><span =
data-colorid=3D"o1tndfnejq">Metrics:</span></strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"bb=
20a39f-d491-4f57-9bcd-05bf78c240aa" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 147.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 232.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 224.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 155.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"088820e6-f3e4-44a5-a784-d780f95d1066">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"f586f65e-1f9c-4403-8=
8a5-5c387024b8ed" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"691eb46f1bd4"><strong>Metric</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"07e3518b-3eae-439d-b=
4af-0f6e4a44581c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5dd283e3042e"><strong>Definition</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"e4cfc394-b3eb-4ff0-b=
46e-eb2623ecbcdc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"db23876c7380"><strong>Business Logic / Calculation Rule</str=
ong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"5ad3fed6-da0b-49fa-8=
dab-4af7c0ced4ee" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a0b661ac0802"><strong>Example</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"1febb082-8f27-4d99-8258-ee60cd76d6dd">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"2d233a3d-910c-4083-8=
fd0-826e5673b275" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e0a2686710da"><strong>Total Orders</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"bd961bf5-a0e8-4e90-9=
780-4a3a9ad526db" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"859a19b7efea">The total number of orders created during the =
selected date range, regardless of their current status.</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"523d3bae-b35f-431e-a=
8d3-8b9937c67588" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7d7187e24304">Calculation Rule:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ece6f613b9b2">
<li local-id=3D"1004a21889e0">
<p local-id=3D"76eb3d1c706e">Filter orders using the Order Creation Date.</=
p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"c779559801e1">
<li local-id=3D"516e72267bcf">
<p local-id=3D"98c85a09a154">Count every order created within the selected =
date range.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"6f33f63ee264">
<li local-id=3D"e223993ab12a">
<p local-id=3D"fce8e547417a">Includes orders from all sources (Website, Sto=
refront, Telesales, etc.).</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"41d81013-f498-485e-8=
189-12f6801df35d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f7cf207b79ce">Filter Date: Today</p>
<p local-id=3D"7f334c504167">Website Orders =3D 10</p>
<p local-id=3D"d13f03c97b22">Telesales Orders =3D 8</p>
<p local-id=3D"321de5d673ea"><strong>Total Orders =3D 18</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c580544d-66cd-4624-99e8-01f7129b649a">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"2f5c7ab5-9dc8-4a56-a=
06e-ef4343036148" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e309fbaf9b8a"><strong>Average Order Value </strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"6ff3341c-7b8c-4fb8-b=
687-c2227ac76b61" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c93994efde9f">The average monetary value of each order place=
d during the selected date range. It helps measure how much customers spend=
 per order.</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"5f8d7492-0788-495b-9=
e01-694862e611b0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"681cf56e7f8b"><strong>Formula:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f92a6123c08c"><strong>AOV =3D Total Revenue =C3=B7 Total Ord=
ers</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"502402caec1c">
<li local-id=3D"876401e2c60d">
<p local-id=3D"3145ed6a9607">Filter completed or valid orders (based on bus=
iness rule).</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"26979b805c5d">
<li local-id=3D"7d3aa69ceee9">
<p local-id=3D"1f31bf63d850">Sum the total order value.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"129f2e8b8f9e">
<li local-id=3D"80fa1dc40038">
<p local-id=3D"0ed3aface81e">Divide by the total number of orders.</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"89aeeb01-6a7f-4285-b=
974-0abb86139752" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"02a0a0504f10">Filter Date: Today</p>
<p local-id=3D"c3dd562734e9">Total Revenue =3D =E0=A7=B318,000Total Orders =
=3D 18</p>
<p local-id=3D"8c166674693c"><strong>AOV =3D =E0=A7=B31,000</strong></p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e93b5ced-69c5-464f-b194-4754b85b8e92">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"29f6f9e5-c405-46c9-9=
a7b-6bcc67a0305f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c8614a3ecfff"><strong>Completed Orders</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"995c1345-0d41-4278-9=
8fe-4a04a84f4d94" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ff537fc36149">The total number of orders whose current statu=
s is Completed within the selected date range.</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"25cd5c3f-c59b-49de-a=
133-aae0825827c1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1aea9afcb4b2"><strong>Calculation Rule:</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"00b215dd495b">
<li local-id=3D"62d565f0d630">
<p local-id=3D"87378b2bae30">Filter orders by Order Creation Date.</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"1a882e261e17">
<li local-id=3D"1f61ca291da0">
<p local-id=3D"734b53247cb7">Count only orders whose current status is <str=
ong>Completed</strong>.</p></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"83994526-11e5-4713-b=
787-8da424511118" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"266ef1940561">Filter Date: Today</p>
<p local-id=3D"e4e80552efa7">Total Orders =3D 18</p>
<p local-id=3D"9a70486e870b">Completed Orders =3D 6</p>
<p local-id=3D"056882ff7f8c"><strong>Completed Orders =3D 6</strong></p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cb02b01f-ff4b-44e8-af2a-7e014a61fc03">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"e93624fc-c390-46b8-9=
be3-a721a2606763" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f7de4a38bf7"><strong>Not Completed Orders</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"390802c9-b4d1-48de-8=
742-cc1e40a3548c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"35eaab5f9f28">The total number of orders that have not yet r=
eached the <strong>Completed</strong> status. This includes Pending, Confir=
med, Processing, Cancelled, Returned, or any other non-completed status dep=
ending on the business rules.</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"b2e682e7-b95a-49fb-b=
51a-959faf88380a" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"632bd4491fe0"><strong>Formula:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"2be8a9924433"><strong>Not Completed Orders =3D </strong>Tota=
l Orders =E2=88=92 Completed Orders</p>
<p local-id=3D"e478360fbae4">or Count all orders whose current status is no=
t Completed.</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"75507278-b7f8-4076-8=
248-6b5ea5007b2d" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3370f7e9b026">Filter Date: Today</p>
<p local-id=3D"4419f69c457a">Total Orders =3D 18</p>
<p local-id=3D"125f424552fa">Completed Orders =3D 6</p>
<p local-id=3D"8d169ce7c873"><strong>Not Completed Orders =3D 12</strong></=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e9fd2637-ea2b-4f89-9117-4dc1564b4074">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"1f64c8a6-a19c-461b-b=
458-5bb7317a1098" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c3917b456fc2"><strong>Average First Response</strong></p></t=
d>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"66f2cae2-f2ad-4229-9=
5d3-75b1615b272e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"04f96bbe429f">The average time taken by the support or opera=
tions team to provide the first response after an order is created. This me=
asures the team's responsiveness.</p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"e6366c25-3984-4728-8=
976-b61389470de0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"363b5dabed4e"><strong>Formula:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"f4fa674a4102"><strong>Average First Response =3D </strong>=
=CE=A3(First Response Time =E2=88=92 Order Creation Time) =C3=B7 Number of =
Responded Orders</p>
<ul local-id=3D"ac0e439985bf">
<li local-id=3D"7031c6be3b2a">
<p local-id=3D"2222e7177262">Calculate the response time for each order.</p=
></li>
</ul></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"febcd37f-5c68-48cb-8=
e34-4ab631f8219c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"76c9da16c892"><strong>Example:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"9a01a669e193">Order 1 =3D 3 min</p>
<p local-id=3D"2a0a01c0b1bb">Order 2 =3D 5 min</p>
<p local-id=3D"8806deb6020d">Order 3 =3D 7 min</p>
<p local-id=3D"4061b8870605">Average =3D (3 + 5 + 7) =C3=B7 3 =3D <strong>5=
 minutes</strong></p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"372ee8afe4f3" id=3D"OrderAnalytics-Charts:"><strong><span d=
ata-colorid=3D"gsj266mpdd">Charts:</span></strong></h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"6b=
a027d0-d5ee-484c-b1ba-8fdcaa52d4d6" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ab7a1ae5-5d76-4c9e-9fd2-4a7e95576b5d">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"89578787-f130-466a-a=
ef3-b9d9377fd18e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"41cf623768cf"><strong>Chart</strong></p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"588f6ccd-8dd9-4c13-a=
12a-cba3bc2c330e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2b5377c540c9"><strong>Definition / Business Logic</strong></=
p></td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"df9944b6-1b4e-4f4f-b=
d41-d5c212426eae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"55365d8605b1"><strong>Example</strong></p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"191bf527-525c-4c9a-90f7-30c90613a48a">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"4b582592-76fe-427a-9=
3a2-2283b5d7e2ce" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5ec28587abdf"><strong>New vs Return Customers</strong></p></=
td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"2be74767-e383-4127-8=
d0e-5dae35782540" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2e849c604355">Displays the distribution of <strong>new</stro=
ng> and <strong>returning</strong> customers within the selected date range=
. A <strong>New Customer</strong> is someone placing their first order. A <=
strong>Returning Customer</strong> is someone who has placed at least one o=
rder before. <strong>Calculation Rule:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"1ff958110b7b">=E2=80=A2 Filter orders by Order Creation Date=
.</p>
<p local-id=3D"d3a073088103">=E2=80=A2 Check customer's order history.</p>
<p local-id=3D"4e3281d03627">=E2=80=A2 If previous order exists =E2=86=92 R=
eturn Customer.</p>
<p local-id=3D"e6f15780e152">=E2=80=A2 Otherwise =E2=86=92 New Customer.</p=
>
<p local-id=3D"efb9f1f70963">=E2=80=A2 Display count and percentage.</p></t=
d>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"713a96c8-f521-4eea-8=
2f5-0b6f9079fac8" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"aba4d4856cde"><strong>Filter Date:</strong> Today</p>
<p local-id=3D"b614470e258f">Total Customers =3D 12</p>
<p local-id=3D"851657c15e79">New Customers =3D 5 (41.7%)</p>
<p local-id=3D"cfc3b8f09187">Returning Customers =3D 7 (58.3%)</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9c9b19ce-c794-4e4d-9524-fb9aa8c0c75a">
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"a14850bd-ba31-46ca-9=
9c1-4ffcd741a160" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8627f4f21a54"><strong>Orders by Mobile Carrier</strong></p><=
/td>
<td data-highlight-colour=3D"#ffffff" data-local-id=3D"67f558a8-0889-4d09-b=
464-01531ddcc54f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"b98de397c572">Displays the number of orders grouped by the c=
ustomer's mobile operator.</p>
<p local-id=3D"513181873aaf"><strong>Calculation Rule:</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"569782b9fa4c">=E2=80=A2 Read customer's phone number.</p>
<p local-id=3D"a07bd7c4d3ca">=E2=80=A2 Identify carrier using the phone pre=
fix.</p>
<p local-id=3D"5e871397e893">=E2=80=A2 Group orders by carrier.</p>
<p local-id=3D"79d0ace0190b">=E2=80=A2 Display count and percentage for eac=
h carrier.</p></td>
